   "k": "14z6r8",
   "en": "Playing as ⟦0⟧ is very hard, the first problem that needs to be addressed is the player's total lack of industry. ⟦1⟧ actually holds the title for having the lowest starting industry out of any nation in the game. Along with ⟦2⟧ for that matter.",
